# Owner: offline operator Engine.response_bytes; existing typed configuration field.
# Purpose: bound each Engine response, including complete native configuration-archive readback.
# Type/unit: integer bytes, permitted4096..16777216; generic default1048576.
# This current cumulative CPU inventory has10 locale files/4552871 payload bytes,
# plus tar framing and the fixed readback reserve. Explicitly select8388608.
# Required behavior: choose a sufficient complete-role bound before init-scope;
# missing assets or insufficient bounds refuse. Per-file metadata and all integrity
# assertions remain unchanged; this is not a complete202-language inventory.
# Secret handling: nonsecret numeric bound; no credential, key or private data value.
# Mapping/precedence: explicit protected operator --env-file overrides Engine JSON
# through configuration.Load. Ambient variables and Compose interpolation do not.
# Merge the existing Engine socket/profile settings and other protected JSON inputs
# first; this file overrides only the response bound and supplies no socket default.
# Apply: read once per invocation, without rebuild. The original scope fingerprint
# binds this selection; changing it requires a new scope, preserving the old one.
PROJECT_ONE_OFFLINE_OPERATOR_ENGINE_RESPONSE_BYTES=8388608
